
Change-log for SpeechPlugin.dll

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
14/10/26  v0.8.0.0 :
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	Reading sentence by sentence: Previous sentence / Next sentence commands
	Play / Pause command: when nothing is read, reads from the selection or the cursor
	Speak from Here command (from the selection, or from the sentence of the cursor)
	The sentence being read is highlighted and kept visible (option)
	Toolbar buttons: previous sentence, play / pause, next sentence, stop (option)
	A speed change applies from the next sentence with OneCore voices too
	Menu changed: Pause and Resume replaced by Play / Pause

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
13/10/26  v0.7.0.0 :
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	Windows OneCore voices (Julie, Paul, Hortense...) in addition to SAPI voices
	Voice selection and reading speed setting (Speech Settings dialog)
	Speak faster / Speak slower commands, settings saved in SpeechPlugin.ini
	Optional right-click menu entries
	English and French menus (automatic: same language as Notepad++)
	Fixed: crash on ANSI documents with non UTF-8 characters
	Fixed: 64-bit text positions (SCI_GETTEXTRANGEFULL)
	Fixed: voice released while speaking, XML/HTML text parsed as SAPI markup

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
29/10/08  v0.2.1.0 :
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	Made compatible with Notepad++ 5.1 - Unicode release

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
10/01/08  v0.2.0.1 :
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	Pause speech
	Resume speech
	
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
09/01/08  v0.1.0.0 :
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	Speak selection
	Speak document
	Stop speech
